# `adk deploy agent_engine` writes a coordinator_engine_tmp<timestamp>/ staging
# dir next to the agent dir. Ignore ONLY those -- the previous pattern
# (coordinator_engine*) also matched the real agent directory, so any NEW file
# added there was silently untracked. agent.py/__init__.py/requirements.txt only
# survived because they predate the rule.
coordinator_engine_tmp*